VMS 5.5-2 should automatically recognize the board if the CSR and VECTOR are
set according to CONFIG utility (which is part of SYSGEN).  Make sure you keep
repeating CONFIG until it matches a SYSGEN SHOW CONFIG for all other existing
hardware, then add the CXY08.

